@startuml stage-6-review
title Stage 6 — Review Session  (/mi-review)\nMain context vs. the review-iteration-runner sub-agent

skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #888888
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

legend top left
  |<#FFF3CD>| Main-agent context |
  |<#D6EAF8>| Fresh sub-agent context (one per iteration) |
  |<#E8DAEF>| Persisted artifact store (disk) |
  |<#D4EDDA>| Written this stage |
  |<#FADBD8>| Return summary read by main |
endlegend

package "Persisted artifact store" #E8DAEF {
  artifact "implementation/inspector-review.md\n(### IR-NNN findings: verdict, scope,\n proposed-action)" as IR
  artifact "blueprints/current/requirements.md" as REQ
  artifact "blueprints/current/config.md" as CFG
  artifact "project source code" as SRC
}

package "MAIN AGENT context" #FFF3CD {
  rectangle "Loaded directly:\n• inspector-review.md — open IR-NNN findings\n• review-context.md — compact stage-6 primer\n  (active scope, goals, implemented surface,\n   open-findings cheat sheet)\n\nRuns one review iteration per spawn,\nlooping until inspector types `approve`." as MAIN
}

package "Sub-agent: review-iteration-runner\n(per iteration · model: opus\n tools: Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Skill)" #D6EAF8 {
  rectangle "Injected context:\n• the open IR-NNN findings to address\n• requirements.md / config.md (scope reference)\n• affected source files\n\nPicks smallest scope tier that resolves each:\n  fix -> re-implement -> re-plan -> re-spec\nInvokes cascade Skills (writing-plans,\nbrainstorming) when scope > fix.\nWrites: source edits + commits,\n        IR-NNN status updates via review.sh" as RIR
}

package "Written this stage" #D4EDDA {
  artifact "project source edits + commits" as EDITS
  artifact "implementation/inspector-review.md\n(IR-NNN statuses updated)" as IRU
}

IR --> MAIN : read
MAIN --> RIR : spawn (per iteration)
IR --> RIR : open findings
REQ --> RIR : scope reference
CFG --> RIR : scope reference
SRC --> RIR : reads affected files
RIR --> EDITS
RIR --> IRU
RIR --> MAIN : resolved IR-IDs + unresolved cascades #FADBD8

note bottom of MAIN
  Inspector types `approve` to end the loop,
  then /mi-continue advances to Stage 7 (review completion)
  and Stage 8 (/mi-complete-workflow archival).
end note
@enduml
